      "start_seconds": 283.66,
      "end_seconds": 295.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination right, here's what I'm thinking this is probably a fever after travel that must be treated as possible malaria another possibility is dengue fever"
