      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.56,
      "end_seconds": 325.25,
      "duration_seconds": 24.69,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a fever after travel that must be treated as possible malaria do well once it's treated properly let's get blood cultures, for fever avoid anti-inflammatory painkillers and keep drinking try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit"
